niPlay"}]},"gate":{"kind":"literal","value":true},"position":"objective","objective_title_i18n":{"cn":"排列女神座星象","en":"Align the Stars","jp":"女神座の星図を並べる","kr":"여신자리 별자리 배열하기"},"objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你灵光乍现，猜测在星象仪上排列出女神座的星象或许能够破局。立刻动手尝试吧。","en":"You decide to align the stars into the Astra Throne constellation on the astrolabe, hoping it will open a way into the tower.","jp":"……そうだ！天球儀に女神座の星図を並べれば、状況を打開できるかもしれない。さっそく試してみよう。","kr":"아스트롤라베에 여신자리 별자리를 배열하면 문이 열릴지도 모른다. 어서 시도해 보자."},"assembly_key":"season_6/season_6/main_story/16010111"}},"ep6/quest_story_16111240":{"objective:16010111:3:2":{"step":"16010111:3:2","activity_type":"MagicSeal","title":"Magic seal","start":"object_interaction","evidence":{"condition_field":"ClientFinishCondition","condition":"ed.ConditionX.C_MiniGameSuccess(\"MagicSeal\",11)","puzzle_type":"27","group":"11","launches":[],"menu_offers":[],"object_launches":[{"kind":"object_interaction","object":"510800105","client_type":"BagPuzzleOther","object_parameters":"[27 | 11]","interaction_record":"73","interaction_state":"1","interaction_guard":"true","option":"71","option_type":"MiniPlayOpen","init_states":"[1 | 2 | 5]","final_states":"[11101]","extra_rules":"0","object_interact_conditions":"[]","guards":["player selects the offered MiniPlayOpen button","object is loaded and its native interaction state/condition admits that button"],"consumer":"MapOperation._onOperation -> BaseObjData.GetObjTypeParam -> StartMiniPlay"}]},"gate":{"kind":"literal","value":true},"position":"objective","objective_title_i18n":{"cn":"为同伴解开通行权限","en":"Grant Access","jp":"仲間の通行権限を解放する","kr":"친구들에게 통행 권한 부여하기"},"objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你察觉到格墨文闯入塔内，这必然是迪尔格雷在暗中作祟。即刻使用权限，邀请皮帕和休进入塔内支援。","en":"Gervan has broken into the tower, and you know he is acting on Cyran's behalf. Grant Pippa and Silven access so they can provide their support.","jp":"グレムが塔内に侵入したようだ。裏でディアグレスが動いているに違いない。直ちに権限を行使してピッパーとシューを塔内へ招き入れ、支援を要請しよう。","kr":"그로웬이 마법탑에 침입했다. 분명 딜그레이가 몰래 알려준 것이다. 즉시 내 권한으로